$MDESC::Type = "TAC";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> TAC Find and Retrieve" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Garden of Vishnu" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Foggy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle for control of four flags.  The four flags located in the center of the mission must be brought back to each team's Flag Towers.  Each flag is worth 50 points. The first team to 180 points shall be the victor so don't wreck to many of your own APC's or you may have problems.  Pulse sensor coverage and 10 points can also be gained by controlling two radar towers.  The first team to reach 180 points or the team with the highest score at the end of the time limit will win." @
         "\n\n<f1>For the TAC Mod:<f0> www.tribes-universe.com/tac/" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map designed by:<f0> [TPG]SaNTa[DTM]";